    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M011",
    "new_bytes": 54,
    "old_bytes": 104,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Books start weak, then",
      "grow as you read."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M012",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 58,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "It is getting late.",
      "Be careful down there!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M015",
    "new_bytes": 34,
    "old_bytes": 34,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Eh? You just came",
      "down?"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M024",
    "new_bytes": 48,
    "old_bytes": 46,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Got your Talons and",
      "Saddle equipped?"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M025",
    "new_bytes": 46,
    "old_bytes": 34,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "They only help when",
      "you equip them!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M030",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 52,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "It raises the level of",
      "Talons and Saddles."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M039",
    "new_bytes": 42,
    "old_bytes": 52,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Fuse two Talons or two",
      "Saddles."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M043",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 44,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "I finally found a pearl,",
      "but I dropped it."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M044",
    "new_bytes": 40,
    "old_bytes": 32,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Oh well. I will find",
      "another."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M053",
    "new_bytes": 36,
    "old_bytes": 34,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Oh, there is Magicite",
      "too!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M059",
    "new_bytes": 34,
    "old_bytes": 34,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Now that is a rare",
      "item!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M060",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 60,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Oh, do you call",
      "unusual items rare items?"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M062",
    "new_bytes": 56,
    "old_bytes": 66,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "You should not go too",
      "deep into the dungeon."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M063",
    "new_bytes": 50,
    "old_bytes": 32,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Do not overdo it.",
      "Return to the village!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M070",
    "new_bytes": 100,
    "old_bytes": 72,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "I was taking it out",
      "when a monster appeared.",
      "It got scared and ran",
      "off somewhere."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M079",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 40,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Then spread your",
      "feathers a little more."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M081",
    "new_bytes": 54,
    "old_bytes": 62,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Now your feather bag",
      "holds a few more items."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M083",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 40,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Then I will take him",
      "up to the surface."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M086",
    "new_bytes": 64,
    "old_bytes": 50,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "This came from {Doru},",
      "the Djungarian hamster."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M087",
    "new_bytes": 54,
    "old_bytes": 46,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "He sent it to thank",
      "you for rescuing him."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M089",
    "new_bytes": 108,
    "old_bytes": 90,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Blow it and {Doru} will",
      "bring you an item.",
      "It comes from",
      "{Atla's Dresser}."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M097",
    "new_bytes": 48,
    "old_bytes": 46,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "{Camilla's Dad} is safe,",
      "but..."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M108",
    "new_bytes": 46,
    "old_bytes": 42,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "See you. My identity",
      "is a secret."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M117",
    "new_bytes": 56,
    "old_bytes": 78,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "I see. The {furnace}",
      "is powering up!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M121",
    "new_bytes": 54,
    "old_bytes": 46,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "I should tell {Rask}",
      "about this too."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M135",
    "new_bytes": 36,
    "old_bytes": 22,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "Come on. Let us go",
      "home."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M141",
    "new_bytes": 38,
    "old_bytes": 34,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "So he really is a good",
      "guy."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M142",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 36,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "A lot happens when you",
      "are with him, huh?"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M151",
    "new_bytes": 36,
    "old_bytes": 30,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "I came to give you",
      "this!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M159",
    "new_bytes": 34,
    "old_bytes": 34,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "I found another",
      "flowerpot!"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M163",
    "new_bytes": 80,
    "old_bytes": 64,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "The Tyrian Crystal",
      "absorbs people.",
      "Their wishes form",
      "dungeons."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M168",
    "new_bytes": 54,
    "old_bytes": 44,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "It bursts, sending",
      "copies across the world."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M172",
    "new_bytes": 52,
    "old_bytes": 74,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "I sought it before it",
      "took anyone else."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M177",
    "new_bytes": 66,
    "old_bytes": 54,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "You care about {Atla},",
      "but like these items too?"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M185",
    "new_bytes": 46,
    "old_bytes": 46,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Lately I forgot what",
      "that duty was."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M186",
    "new_bytes": 94,
    "old_bytes": 98,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "Someone's heart was",
      "twisted by the crystal.",
      "I am that heart's cry",
      "for help."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M187",
    "new_bytes": 82,
    "old_bytes": 94,
    "mode": "inplace",
    "lines": [
      "I can go between the",
      "dungeon and the surface.",
      "But I cannot fight."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M188",
    "new_bytes": 50,
    "old_bytes": 42,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "My duty is to seek",
      "someone who can help."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M189",
    "new_bytes": 48,
    "old_bytes": 40,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "I help you find",
      "those needing rescue."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G09:M192",
    "new_bytes": 96,
    "old_bytes": 92,
    "mode": "allocate",
    "lines": [
      "{Atla} is asking you",
      "to save him.",
      "My role is to help",
      "you do that."
    ]
  }
]
